step 36 "get all"
out dec "You get a lantern.\n\rYou get a scarlet and blue stone.\n\rYou get a pale blue stone.\n\rYou get the curse of the mummy.\n\rYou get a druish staff.\n\rYou get a battle axe.\n\rYou get a metal shield.\n\rYou get a thick marble bracelet.\n\rYou get a standard issue bracer.\n\rYou get a leather bracer.\n\rYou get a holstered belt.\n\rYou get a standard issue cape.\n\rYou get some leather sleeves.\n\rYou get a pair of leather gloves.\n\rYou get some leather boots.\n\rYou get some leather leggings.\n\rYou get a smurf hat.\n\rYou get a leather vest.\n\rYou get a strange amulet.\n\rYou get a small necklace.\n\rYou get a golden necklace.\n\rYou get a copper ring.\n\rYou get a bronze ring.\n\rYou get a seashell ring.\n\rYou get an emerald ring.\n\r\n\r<29hp 102m 106mv> \xff\xf9"
out god "\n\rDecimus gets a lantern.\n\rDecimus gets a scarlet and blue stone.\n\rDecimus gets a pale blue stone.\n\rDecimus gets the curse of the mummy.\n\rDecimus gets a druish staff.\n\rDecimus gets a battle axe.\n\rDecimus gets a metal shield.\n\rDecimus gets a thick marble bracelet.\n\rDecimus gets a standard issue bracer.\n\rDecimus gets a leather bracer.\n\rDecimus gets a holstered belt.\n\rDecimus gets a standard issue cape.\n\rDecimus gets some leather sleeves.\n\rDecimus gets a pair of leather gloves.\n\rDecimus gets some leather boots.\n\rDecimus gets some leather leggings.\n\rDecimus gets a smurf hat.\n\rDecimus gets a leather vest.\n\rDecimus gets a strange amulet.\n\rDecimus gets a small necklace.\n\rDecimus gets a golden necklace.\n\rDecimus gets a copper ring.\n\rDecimus gets a bronze ring.\n\rDecimus gets a seashell ring.\n\rDecimus gets an emerald ring.\n\r\n\r<100hp 100m 100mv> \xff\xf9"
